   "author": "Robert Hurd, CPA",
   "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/robert-hurd-cpa-a9a09173_newbeginnings-activity-7520920086472228867-Y-BS",
   "text": "Excited to share that I started a new chapter at Etched yesterday.\n\nI have always loved building things, and joining the team at Etched is where that curiosity becomes the work.\n\nThank you to the mentors, teammates, and friends who got me here. And most of all, to my wife (Vanessa Hurd, CPA) and family, who make every next step possible.\n\n#NewBeginnings",
