   "text": "Branding and web design for DVC by Daniil Sergeev\n\nDVC is a fund that brings together 190+ investors and has backed 120 AI startups, including Perplexity AI, Etched, and Thinking Machines Lab. \n\nThe brand identity centers on multilayered and color cluster visuals, symbolizing a community of engineers, founders, and angels, all managed by a family of founders.",
