   "added": 1793177769
  },
  "7521201790776795136": {
   "created": 1793194244,
   "author": "Harshavardhan Malla",
   "url": "https://www.linkedin.com/posts/harshavardhanmalla_linkedin-is-paying-120000-to-195000-for-activity-7521201790776795136-gQjt",
   "text": "LinkedIn is paying $120,000 to $195,000 for a Software Engineer, Systems and Infrastructure.\n\nOne of 245 new US infrastructure and SRE roles in the last 24 hours. 49% are at employers with H-1B history.\n\n13 I checked open on the employer's own site today:\n\n1. LinkedIn \u2014 Software Engineer, Systems and Infrastructure\nBellevue, WA \u00b7 $120,000 to $195,000 \u00b7 H-1B history\n\n2. Ford Motor Company \u2014 AI Platform Engineer\nAllen Park, MI \u00b7 $99,600 to $166,600 \u00b7 H-1B history\n\n3. Superhuman Platform \u2014 Software Engineer, Back-End - Mail (US)\nUS \u00b7 $154,000 to $214,000 \u00b7 H-1B history\n\n4. Apple \u2014 Site Reliability Engineer, Retail and Marcom Engineering\nAustin, Texas \u00b7 H-1B history\n\n5. Sony Interactive Entertai",
